# Preserve the pinned source assets required by manifests and explicit document
# selection. Tracking them does not enable inherited customer templates.
!email-templates-temp/*.docx
!backend/modules/communications/infra/adapters/static/TermsAndConditions_CY.pdf
!backend/modules/communications/infra/adapters/static/TermsAndConditions_PT.pdf
!backend/products/motor/documents/static/Abbeygate_Motor_Cyprus_IPID_LIC_Santam_UMR_B176026EEA6152.pdf
!backend/products/motor/documents/static/Abbeygate_Motor_Portugal_IPID_LIC_Santam_August2026.pdf
!backend/products/travel/documents/static/Brit_Travel_AnnualMultiTrip_IPID.pdf
!backend/products/travel/documents/static/Brit_Travel_SingleTrip_IPID.pdf

# ADR-0017 / ABY-97 — re-include the three HOME doc-pack `staticPdf`
# assets the production system literally cannot run without. They live
# under the product folder per CHAMPS canonical-ownership (the same
# pattern motor uses for its templates). The global `*.pdf` ignore
# above keeps every other binary PDF out of the tree.
!backend/products/home/documents/static/BeazleyHome_IPID_CyprusGreeceWithSubsidence2023.pdf
!backend/products/home/documents/static/BeazleyHome_IPID_SpainAndPortugal.pdf
!backend/products/home/documents/static/Beazley_Lloyds_Home_Policy_Wording_Cyprus_(CyprusDomiciled).pdf
# ADR-0048 — tenant + domicile-aware Home wordings (Cyprus UK-domiciled,
# Portugal UK / non-UK) + Greece-specific IPID. Greece is now domicile-split
# (UK / non-UK) per ADR-0073. See backend/products/home/documents/policyWording.ts.
!backend/products/home/documents/static/LloydsHomePolicyWordingCyprus(UKDomiciled)_2024.pdf
!backend/products/home/documents/static/Beazley_Home_Portugal_Domiciled_Policy_Wording_Amended_Clean.pdf
!backend/products/home/documents/static/Beazley_Home_Portugal_UK_Domiciled_Policy_Wording_Amended_Clean.pdf
!backend/products/home/documents/static/Abbeygate_Home_Greece_Domiciled.pdf
!backend/products/home/documents/static/Abbeygate_Home_Greece_UK_Domiciled.pdf
!backend/products/home/documents/static/LloydsHome_IPID_GR.pdf
!backend/products/home/documents/static/NDP82515223207-04-2026.pdf
!backend/products/travel/documents/static/Brit_Travel_Policy_Wording_Amended_Clean.pdf
!backend/products/health/documents/static/BritImmigrationHealthIPID.pdf
!backend/products/health/documents/static/Abbeygate_Immigration_Health_Wording.pdf
!backend/products/motor/documents/static/Abbeygate_Motor_Cyprus_Policy_Wording_AB-S-1-2026.pdf
!backend/products/motor/documents/static/Abbeygate_Motor_Portugal_Policy_Wording_AB-S-1-2026.pdf
!backend/products/motor/documents/static/Abbeygate_Motor_Spain_Policy_Wording_AB-S-1-2026.pdf
# Peter Sheppard 2026-08-07: keep Spain Home wordings for future Facio upload
# only. They are deliberately outside product runtime documents/static and are
# not website/issued-pack assets until a separate Spain launch PR wires them.
!docs/product/future-wordings/spain/Abbeygate_Home_Spain_Domiciled_Clean_Full_Page_Final.pdf
!docs/product/future-wordings/spain/Abbeygate_Home_Spain_UK_Domiciled_Clean.pdf

